ns  multiplicity  cosmomorphism right rather than  anthropomorphism multiple genders  relational power and a promiscuous  embodiment in all things therefore  Jansen concludes if philosophy wants to  be feminist it's going to have to be  pantheist  the argument is straightforward it's  fairly well known lots of people read  Jansen and yet I cannot think of a  single scholar who has taken up this  call rather pantheism and Western  thought continues to be denigrated by  philosophers and theologians of nearly  every school and political persuasion  from the Orthodox to the heretical  Liberals to liberationists eco-feminists  to christo-capitalists whatever it is we  say we are we are not by any means  pantheists to continue watching this  video click the link in the top left or  in the description below or visit iai.tv  for more debates and talks from the  world's leading thinkers on today's  biggest ideas

